{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12944": "AGATA: 这是你做过最好吃的一顿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12945": "AGATA: 而且……说实话，你以前做的很多菜就已经好吃得不得了了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12946": "ALEXANDRA: 吃得太饱，站不起来了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12947": "NIKOLAI: 我还以为家乡的人很会做面包……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12948": "NIKOLAI: 当然，我们确实会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12949": "NIKOLAI: 可这些香草、香料……以后再尝家里的面包香料，恐怕再也不是那个滋味。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12950": "JEROME: 都吃不出那是羊肉、牛肉，后来还有鸡肉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12951": "JEROME: 每道菜仿佛都彻底……变了个样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12952": "AGATA: 一道比一道好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12953": "CORDELIA: 说到这个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12954": "CORDELIA: 你给食物施法了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12955": "BEN: 呃……看你怎么说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12956": "CORDELIA: 既然这么美味，我倒未必反对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12957": "CORDELIA: 不过，风魔法会不会影响我的补牙材料，让我有点担心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12958": "BEN: 确实用了些魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12959": "BEN: 但没用在食物上，没直接用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12960": "CORDELIA: 那怎么用的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12961": "CORDELIA: 为什么看亚历珊德拉？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12962": "BEN: 她，呃，她特别喜欢番茄。谁不喜欢呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12963": "ALEXANDRA: 我帮他改变了番茄地的土壤成分。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12964": "ALEXANDRA: 要弄清怎样用魔法改变氮的浓度，可是连猜带试，费了不少工夫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12965": "BEN: 然后……朱娜帮我找来了所有松露。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12966": "JUNA: 大半靠鼻子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12967": "JUNA: 只稍微引导了林地上的微风。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12968": "BEN: 尼科帮着修炉子，让火候分毫不差。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12969": "NIKOLAI: 那不是魔法，只是换了更好的温度传感器和隔热材料。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12970": "NIKOLAI: 你的厨房没早烧掉，真是奇迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12971": "CORDELIA: 如此宏大的工程，还有谁参与？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12972": "CORDELIA: 你也有份？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12973": "JEROME: 或许有一片橄榄林，雨水比别处稍多一点，也或许没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12974": "JEROME: 不过只在冬天。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12975": "CORDELIA: 冬天？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12976": "CORDELIA: 你究竟筹备了多久？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12977": "BEN: 都说备料占做菜的八成嘛……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12978": "CORDELIA: 毫无疑问，你在这门手艺上投入了大量心血、学识[oxfordComma /]与技艺。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12979": "CORDELIA: 不论哪个世界，恐怕都无人能及。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12980": "CORDELIA: 不过，你对不同事情的用心程度，似乎有点……不太一致。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12981": "BEN: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12982": "CORDELIA: 满足一下我的好奇心，无关紧要的小事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12983": "CORDELIA: 这位一路相伴的魔像，叫什么名字，你还记得吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12984": "BEN: 哦，当然，记得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12985": "BEN: 叫，呃……佐莫斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12986": "BEN: 不，扎哈雷。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12987": "BEN: 扎拉蒂娜？对，扎拉蒂娜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12988": "BEN: 哎，饶了我吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogue-12989": "BEN: 他什么都不吃，我怎么记得住！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogueTester-12990": "想做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogueTester-12991": "仅设置新周目标记！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogueTester-12992": "在新周目迎战乌拉尔特",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogueTester-12993": "观看新周目尾声",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogueTester-12994": "测试新周目解锁提示",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogueTester-12995": "<align=\"center\">全剧终</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/ngpEpilogue.yarn-ngpEpilogueTester-12996": "<align=\"center\">新周目模式已解锁！</align>"
}
